<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>O Thou art God, and Thou art “new“;</l><l>Without Thee all is worn,</l><l>But all with Thee is ever fresh,</l><l>Though many years have gone.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Each blessing Thou hast given us</l><l>Thy newness doth contain;</l><l>Thy covenant, Thy ways are new,</l><l>And ever thus remain.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Now we Thy new creation are—</l><l>New spirit and new heart;</l><l>We’re daily from the old renewed,</l><l>New life Thou dost impart.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>The earth and heavens will be new</l><l>And Thy new city share;</l><l>New fruits each month will be supplied,</l><l>For all is newness there.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>O Father, Thou art ever new,</l><l>And all is new in Thee;</l><l>We sing the new eternal song,</l><l>New praise we give to Thee.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
